@startuml DD-02-production-proposal
title DD-02 - Phuong an HTTPS de doi chieu A2\nDE XUAT - chua chot host/domain, chua deploy, chua co CD
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50

node "Trinh duyet khach hang" as Browser
node "Moi truong ban giao (chua chon nha cung cap)" as Environment {
  node "Reverse proxy / TLS\nHTTPS :443" as Proxy
  node "Next.js web\ninternal :3000" as Web
  node "NestJS API\ninternal :3001" as Api
  node "Migration job\ntruoc rollout API" as Migrate
  database "PostgreSQL\nprivate :5432" as Db
  storage "Persistent data / backup" as Backup
}
node "GitHub Actions\nCI da co; CD can bo sung" as Actions
Browser --> Proxy : HTTPS / JSON
Proxy --> Web : / (web routes)
Proxy --> Api : /api/v1/*
Web ..> Api : URL noi bo neu SSR
Api --> Db : Prisma / SQL
Migrate --> Db : migrations
Db --> Backup : data / backup policy
Actions ..> Migrate : de xuat: sau CI, truoc rollout
Actions ..> Web : de xuat: artifact/SHA + smoke
Actions ..> Api : de xuat: artifact/SHA + smoke

note bottom of Environment
  Cung origin la phuong an de xuat, chua la cau hinh dang chay.
  Khong publish DB/API truc tiep; secret cap qua moi truong/secret store.
  Can chot ADR, domain/TLS, artifact, smoke, backup va rollback.
  compose.yaml hien tai chua co reverse proxy/CD hay URL production.
end note
@enduml
